Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declarations

    2 declarations: declaration declarations
    3             | declaration

    4 declaration: fundec
    5            | fundef
    6            | globaldec
    7            | globaldef

    8 fundec: EXTERN funheader SEMICOLON

    9 fundef: EXPORT funheader BRACE_L funbody BRACE_R
   10       | funheader BRACE_L funbody BRACE_R
   11       | EXPORT funheader BRACE_L BRACE_R
   12       | funheader BRACE_L BRACE_R

   13 funheader: rettype ID BRACKET_L params BRACKET_R
   14          | rettype ID BRACKET_L BRACKET_R

   15 params: param params
   16       | param

   17 param: basictype ID
   18      | basictype SQR_BRACKET_L ID SQR_BRACKET_R ID

   19 rettype: VOIDTYPE
   20        | basictype

   21 basictype: BOOLTYPE
   22          | INTTYPE
   23          | FLOATTYPE

   24 globaldec: EXTERN basictype ID SEMICOLON
   25          | EXTERN basictype SQR_BRACKET_L ID SQR_BRACKET_R ID SEMICOLON

   26 globaldef: EXPORT basictype ID LET expr SEMICOLON
