   46 statements: statement
   47           | statement statements

   48 vardec: basictype ID SEMICOLON
   49       | basictype ID LET expr SEMICOLON
   50       | basictype SQR_BRACKET_L expr SQR_BRACKET_R ID LET arrexpr SEMICOLON
